*.build

# Exception: InWorldz.Phlox is a STANDALONE, hand-maintained project (NOT generated by
# prebuild.xml), so its csproj is not reproducible from a clean checkout + prebuild. Track it
# so the SLua front-end (SLua/SLuaCompiler.cs) and the explicit Compile lists survive. See
# SLUA_TIER1.md sec.9 and the legion-csproj-gitignored memory.
!OpenSim/Addons/Phlox/InWorldz.Phlox/InWorldz.Phlox.csproj
# Phlox.ScriptEngine: hand-maintained sibling project (explicit Compile list + SLua proof files).
# Tracked with relative HintPaths so a clean clone has a usable project without running prebuild
# (re-running prebuild would regenerate OpenSim.sln WITHOUT InWorldz.Phlox). Mirrors the fix above.
!OpenSim/Addons/Phlox/Phlox.ScriptEngine/Phlox.ScriptEngine.csproj
